{"tiddlers":{"$:/plugins/linonetwo/speech-synthesis/widget.js":{"title":"$:/plugins/linonetwo/speech-synthesis/widget.js","text":"\"use strict\";var import_widget=require(\"$:/core/modules/widgets/widget.js\");var SpeechSynthesisWidget=class extends import_widget.widget{refresh(e){return $tw.utils.count(this.computeAttributes())>0?(this.refreshSelf(),!0):this.refreshChildren(e)}render(e,t){this.parentDomNode=e;this.computeAttributes();this.execute();this.renderChildren(e,t)}setState(state){$tw.wiki.addTiddler(new $tw.Tiddler({title:\"$:/state/speech-synthesis\",text:state}))}invokeAction(e,t){const action=this.getAttribute(\"action\",\"speak\");if(action===\"pause\"){window.speechSynthesis.pause();this.setState(\"paused\")}else if(action===\"resume\"){window.speechSynthesis.resume();this.setState(\"playing\")}else if(action===\"stop\"){window.speechSynthesis.cancel();this.setState(\"stopped\")}else if(action===\"toggle\"){if(window.speechSynthesis.speaking){if(window.speechSynthesis.paused){window.speechSynthesis.resume();this.setState(\"playing\")}else{window.speechSynthesis.pause();this.setState(\"paused\")}}else{const s=this.getAttribute(\"text\");s&&this.speak(s)}}else{window.speechSynthesis.cancel();const s=this.getAttribute(\"text\");s&&this.speak(s)}}speak(e){const t=new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(e);const s=window.speechSynthesis.getVoices();t.voice=s[0];t.onstart=()=>this.setState(\"playing\");t.onpause=()=>this.setState(\"paused\");t.onresume=()=>this.setState(\"playing\");t.onend=()=>this.setState(\"stopped\");t.onerror=()=>this.setState(\"stopped\");window.speechSynthesis.speak(t)}};exports[\"speech-synthesis\"]=SpeechSynthesisWidget;","creator":"LinOnetwo","type":"application/javascript","module-type":"widget","hide-body":"yes"},"$:/plugins/linonetwo/speech-synthesis/readme":{"title":"$:/plugins/linonetwo/speech-synthesis/readme","creator":"LinOnetwo","type":"text/vnd.tiddlywiki","text":"\\define text-to-speak() Hello World\n\n<$button>\n  Speak Hello World\n  <$speech-synthesis text=<<text-to-speak>> />\n</$button>\n\nIt works completely offline.\n\n!! Usage\n\n```tw5\n\\define text-to-speak() Hello World\n\n<$button>\n  Speak Hello World\n  <$speech-synthesis text=<<text-to-speak>> />\n</$button>\n\nOr\n\n<$button>\n  Speak Hello World\n  <$speech-synthesis text=\"Hello World\" />\n</$button>\n```\n\n!!! With ChatGPT plugin\n\nInstall [[ChatGPT plugin (talk forum)|https://talk.tiddlywiki.org/t/chatgpt-for-tiddlywiki/6411]], and use output in `<<output-text>>` variable.\n\n```tw5\n<$chat-gpt system_message=\"You are a counselor who likes to quote scripture, using various quotes from famous people to encourage me to go to bed early and not stay up late, encouraging me to leave the electronic device immediately and try to sleep in various ways\">\n\t<$speech-synthesis text=<<output-text>> />\n</$chat-gpt>\n```\n\n!! Browser support\n\nChrome 33+ / Firefox 44+\n\n[[https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Speech_API/Using_the_Web_Speech_API#browser_support_2]]"}}}
